function shiftForm(id,availability=false){const r=rec(availability?'availability':'shifts',id),d=r?.data||{};modal(availability?'Moja dostupnosť':'Zmena',`${!availability?select('Človek','employeeId',employeeOptions(d.employeeId),d.employeeId||me.id):''}${field('Dátum','date',d.date||today(),'date','required')}${field('Od','startTime',d.startTime||'08:00','time','required')}${field('Do','endTime',d.endTime||'16:00','time','required')}${!availability?select('Stav','status',[['draft','Návrh'],['published','Zverejnená']],d.status||'draft'):''}${id&&!availability?area('Dôvod úpravy smeny','reason','','required'):''}`, 'Uložiť',v=>{const {reason,...values}=v;return save(availability?'availability':'shifts',id,{...d,...values,employeeId:availability?me.id:v.employeeId},reason||'',r?.version||0);});}
